# OpenSky Network REST API, the response of GET /states/all and /states/own: a JSON object
# with the time the state vectors belong to and the state vectors themselves. Written by
# hand from the documentation's table. Only `time` is mapped: each state vector is a JSON
# array whose members are addressed by position, which the json wire cannot address
# (pack.md, Not mapped). LicenseRef-OpenSky.
format  opensky-states
version 0.1.0
distribution public
source  "OpenSky Network REST API documentation: github.com/openskynetwork/opensky-api commit 98fecf7438dfbd23c4a26c8a7286a25b805eb2d3, docs/free/states-response.rst (sha256 cc37bfd2dab4c0d6390c2b4b584551902b9948bfd16852e96eb5d629b5313660) and docs/free/track-response.rst (sha256 31ebefef70f0d51d06eb4c7b1e26823b43acd2eefc46ca93ba2ba6fe4bb0d243); LicenseRef-OpenSky"
uses    opensky
wire    json

field  time_ms  time  iscale:1000
